<speak>A loose itinerary, definitely, though I do like to know where we are sleeping. My husband could spend a whole evening comparing routes and maps, but I do not want every hour arranged. I enjoy walking around a town, finding a little café, and sitting somewhere without feeling that we are falling behind schedule. We have had holidays where everyone was determined to see everything. By the end, I needed a quiet day at home to recover from all the sightseeing.</speak>